{
  "file_id": "3523",
  "text_count": 158,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������What's that sound?!",
      "_offset": 3812,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "It sounded like a gear.",
      "_offset": 3840,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "It wasn't a flying saucer, was it?",
      "_offset": 3864,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Whatever it is, it doesn't give me\na good feeling.",
      "_offset": 3899,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Yeah. Well, standing here talking \nabout it won't get us anywhere. \nShould we try following it?",
      "_offset": 3950,
      "_length": 95,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Instead of worrying about that, we\nshould look for clues to see if\nthere are any other humans here.",
      "_offset": 4046,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Hey, Sora!",
      "_offset": 4146,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "What is it, Piyomon?",
      "_offset": 4157,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I feel better since we're \ntraveling together, Sora! I want\nto learn all I can about you!",
      "_offset": 4178,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "You're just going out and saying\nthat outright...",
      "_offset": 4268,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Piyomon's a real friendly Digimon.",
      "_offset": 4318,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Hey, Sora! Let's hold hands!",
      "_offset": 4353,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "(Can I really get along with a\nclingy Digimon like her?)",
      "_offset": 4382,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "The road!",
      "_offset": 4439,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Sora! I don't care how much sand\nthere is, I'll follow you wherever\nyou go!",
      "_offset": 4449,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Wait! Piyomon!",
      "_offset": 4525,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "We keep walking and walking, but I\ncan't see anything.",
      "_offset": 4540,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Considering all the telephone\npoles we're seeing, surely there \nmust be humans around somewhere.",
      "_offset": 4595,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Wait a second! I'll try using my\npocket telescope.",
      "_offset": 4692,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Aaaaargh! Where in the world are\nwe?!",
      "_offset": 4743,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Huh...? Ah? Ah! There's a village!",
      "_offset": 4781,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "And if there's a village, that\nmeans there have to be humans!",
      "_offset": 4816,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "All right! Let's head for that\nvillage!",
      "_offset": 4878,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 4918,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "...And it was a Yokomon village.",
      "_offset": 4924,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Yokomon! Yokomon are my friends!",
      "_offset": 4958,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Let's ask them if they've seen any\nother humans around here.",
      "_offset": 4993,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "What kind of Digimon are you?",
      "_offset": 5054,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Huh? Me?!",
      "_offset": 5084,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "This is a creature called a\n\"human\".",
      "_offset": 5094,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "A \"human\"? Not a Digimon?",
      "_offset": 5131,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Seems like they haven't seen other\nhumans before.",
      "_offset": 5157,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "How did you evolve, Piyomon?",
      "_offset": 5207,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "After I met Sora, I was suddenly\nable to evolve.",
      "_offset": 5236,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "So you can only evolve when a\nhuman's around?",
      "_offset": 5285,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "It must be because I want to\nprotect Sora!",
      "_offset": 5331,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Protect me? But she's so clingy!\nDoes she *really* think she can do\nthat?",
      "_offset": 5374,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "We'll treat you to a feast later,\nso please look forward to it!",
      "_offset": 5448,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Humans are really big. I'd like to\nlet you rest in my house, but you\nwon't fit.",
      "_offset": 5512,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "You sound different now, Piyomon.\nAre you talking like a human?",
      "_offset": 5592,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Are you the only ones in this\nvillage?",
      "_offset": 5656,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "It's just us. But there's a\nDigimon called Meramon who lives\non Outlook Mountain.",
      "_offset": 5695,
      "_length": 81,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Meramon... Outlook Mountain...",
      "_offset": 5777,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Come to think of it, I saw\nsomething falling towards Outlook\nMountain earlier.",
      "_offset": 5808,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "We saw a black gear a while ago!",
      "_offset": 5887,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Maybe that black gear's around\nhere.",
      "_offset": 5920,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Did it fly in this direction?",
      "_offset": 5957,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "_offset": 5987,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Either way, my throat is really,\nreally dry.",
      "_offset": 5993,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "There's a well here! The water\ncomes from Outlook Mountain, so\nit's delicious!",
      "_offset": 6038,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "W-we're saved!",
      "_offset": 6117,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "But the well's dried up.",
      "_offset": 6132,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "It's empty now, but it had water\nup until yesterday...",
      "_offset": 6157,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I'm buuuuuurniiiiiiiiing!",
      "_offset": 6212,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "What was that?!",
      "_offset": 6238,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "It's coming from Outlook Mountain!\nLemme use my telescope.",
      "_offset": 6254,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "I'm burning...I'm...",
      "_offset": 6313,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "I'm burning up right nooooow!",
      "_offset": 6334,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "It's Meramon! He's screaming and\nrunning this way!",
      "_offset": 6364,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "This isn't how Meramon usually is!",
      "_offset": 6415,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "If he gets here, he'll burn down\nthe village!",
      "_offset": 6450,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Everyone, let's get out of here\nnow!",
      "_offset": 6496,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "But where do we run?!",
      "_offset": 6533,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "There's a boat in the lake! We\ncould do some hidin' in there.",
      "_offset": 6555,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "All right, everyone, let's go!",
      "_offset": 6617,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Wait! It looks like some of the\nYokomon are missing!",
      "_offset": 6648,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "We have to help them escape!",
      "_offset": 6702,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Thanks, Sora! I'll help you!",
      "_offset": 6731,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "There's still Yokomon in the\nvillage! Sora, we have to hurry up\nand help them!",
      "_offset": 6760,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Right! I'm coming!",
      "_offset": 6840,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "We've evacuated the Yokomon\nvillage. Piyomon?",
      "_offset": 6859,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Come this way!",
      "_offset": 6906,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Piyomon! You came to save me!",
      "_offset": 6921,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "We're friends, aren't we?",
      "_offset": 6951,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "You idiot...\ntrying to help others at the last\nminute...",
      "_offset": 6977,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Sora! What's wrong? Come back!",
      "_offset": 7034,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Piyomoooooon!",
      "_offset": 7069,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Sora? Did you come here to save\nme?",
      "_offset": 7083,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Of course I did! You're my friend\nand you're important to me!",
      "_offset": 7119,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Thank you, Sora!",
      "_offset": 7181,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "This time, I'll protect you!",
      "_offset": 7198,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "We have to help Piyomon too!",
      "_offset": 7227,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Magical Fire!",
      "_offset": 7256,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Baby Flame!",
      "_offset": 7270,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Petit Fire!",
      "_offset": 7282,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Keheheheheheh...",
      "_offset": 7294,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Meramon is absorbing all of the\nattacks! They won't work on him!",
      "_offset": 7311,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "I'm burning up!",
      "_offset": 7376,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Piyomon!",
      "_offset": 7392,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Sora... Sora's in danger...\nI can't just give up!",
      "_offset": 7401,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Piyomon evolved!",
      "_offset": 7451,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "It's because I promised to protect\nyou, Sora.",
      "_offset": 7468,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Thank you!",
      "_offset": 7514,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Uuuughhhhhh!",
      "_offset": 7525,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "We won with the power of\nBirdramon's fire!",
      "_offset": 7538,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "That's...the black gear!",
      "_offset": 7581,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "That black gear was in Meramon's\nbody! That's why...",
      "_offset": 7606,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Sora! Sora!",
      "_offset": 7659,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Piyomon! Thank you so much!",
      "_offset": 7671,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "It was only natural! It's because\nI love you, Sora!",
      "_offset": 7699,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Why was I...?",
      "_offset": 7751,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Meramon! You're back to normal!",
      "_offset": 7765,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "A black gear fell from the sky...\nafter that...I don't know...",
      "_offset": 7797,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "You don't remember, Meramon?",
      "_offset": 7860,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Meramon! Please keep protecting\nOutlook Mountain like you did\nbefore!",
      "_offset": 7889,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Like I did before...?",
      "_offset": 7959,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Looks like the Yokomon really\nlike you, since you've stopped\nbeing a bad Digimon.",
      "_offset": 7981,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "Is that so? Then I'll return to\nOutlook Mountain.",
      "_offset": 8064,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "Everyone! The Yokomon said\nthey'll give us food as thanks!",
      "_offset": 8114,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Yay!",
      "_offset": 8174,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Piyomon saved me...",
      "_offset": 8179,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "She actually evolved because I was\nin danger.",
      "_offset": 8199,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "All right! Please hurry and escape\nthat way!",
      "_offset": 8245,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "You saved me!",
      "_offset": 8290,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
